OL,3,GNEWSACalls double at CCTV centre during
OL,4,Afreshers' week
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of calls for help at a CCTV
OL,7,Fcentre doubles at the start of the new
OL,8,Funiversity academic year, bosses have
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FThe team in the Exeter CCTV control
OL,12,Froom monitor more than 300 cameras and
OL,13,Fdozens of "safe signs" that feature a
OL,14,Fphone and location number across the
OL,15,Fcity centre.
OL,17,FDennis Cavanagh, city centre and
OL,18,Fcontrol operations manager at Exeter
OL,19,FCity Council, said the majority of
OL,20,Fincidents involved anti-social
OL,21,Fbehaviour due to excess drinking.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
