OL,3,GNEWSACalls double at CCTV centre during
OL,4,Afreshers' week
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We are there to reassure people that
OL,7,Fthey are being monitored by CCTV, they
OL,8,Fare able to speak to a friendly voice
OL,9,Fwho knows where they are and that help
OL,10,Fis on the way," he said.
